{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DIG. SURVIVE. GET RICH\u2026 OR DIE TRYING.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864450/extras/b0fb7fd9206dd45560b74972dd91e566.poster.avif?t=1763994809\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864450/extras/b0fb7fd9206dd45560b74972dd91e566.webm?t=1763994809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GOBLIN COMPANY</strong> is a co-op mining game where every meter you dig could be your last. Armed with laser drills, you and your fellow goblins must reach the legendary Giant Nugget in the WHAAG MINING INC mines. But the depths hold ravenous creatures and a darkness that devours sanity. Can you claim the treasure?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVERY DIVE IS DIFFERENT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carve your own paths through the caves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the environment according to your exploration strategies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864450/extras/fa45d047dc0b16bc3750c48c5b13e7b2.poster.avif?t=1763994809\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864450/extras/fa45d047dc0b16bc3750c48c5b13e7b2.webm?t=1763994809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COMBAT AND SURVIVAL</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face underground creatures guarding the most precious crystals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance exploration, combat, and resource gathering</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864450/extras/8a97fb607785e9da1057686a01fb7b61.poster.avif?t=1763994809\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864450/extras/8a97fb607785e9da1057686a01fb7b61.webm?t=1763994809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MINING TRANSPORT SYSTEM</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a rail network for mining carts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize routes to maximize efficiency while you explore</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864450/extras/483d6c6b7a8a8dacaf3dac398b504b19.poster.avif?t=1763994809\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864450/extras/483d6c6b7a8a8dacaf3dac398b504b19.webm?t=1763994809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEAR OF THE DARK MANAGEMENT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay in the light or anxiety will consume you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic torch system: carry them, throw them, or plant them strategically</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864450/extras/5a9e77da7fc439c8849b6c306f3624f2.poster.avif?t=1763994809\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864450/extras/5a9e77da7fc439c8849b6c306f3624f2.webm?t=1763994809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GEAR UP &amp; GO FASTER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your laser, boost your abilities, and customize your goblin to dig harder, faster, and... smarter?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864450/extras/31aaf9ec2c0c64a2f246ba0e8851c952.poster.avif?t=1763994809\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864450/extras/31aaf9ec2c0c64a2f246ba0e8851c952.webm?t=1763994809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TEAM UP OR GO ALONE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the depths alone or with up to 3 fellow goblins. Share torches to keep the darkness at bay, watch each other's backs, and combine your efforts to uncover the path to the Giant Nugget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864450/extras/c77438f67df44bbc3b4db469ea41ea47.poster.avif?t=1763994809\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864450/extras/c77438f67df44bbc3b4db469ea41ea47.webm?t=1763994809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PROGRESSION AND UPGRADES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your laser to not just destroy, but also create terrain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your mining operation with new Autominers and equipment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864450/extras/26fcb292c14e5308c91d76d9caccf968.poster.avif?t=1763994809\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864450/extras/26fcb292c14e5308c91d76d9caccf968.webm?t=1763994809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Giant Nugget awaits in the deepest darkness</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s down there somewhere\u2026 and the company wants it.<br>If you find it, you\u2019ll be rich.<br>If you die, they\u2019ll just send another goblin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig together with up to 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, fight, and gather resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 different biomes to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own railway network</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use torches to combat darkness </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customise your Goblin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock valuable tools</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op and offline single player</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Die and you'll be replaced</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3864450?t=1763994809","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3864450?t=1763994809","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864450/33b948283576f00693021453ce6ddf5e28761445/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763994809","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamst